    {
      "term": "APR",
      "partOfSpeech": "abbreviation",
      "meaning": "① 年百分率（annual percentage rate）。以年率表示的借款成本指标，可能包括利息及某些费用；具体费用范围取决于产品和适用规则。",
      "chineseAliases": [
        "贷款年百分率",
        "年百分率"
      ],
      "englishForms": [
        "APRs"
      ],
      "en": "Both loan offers list the same interest rate, but their APRs differ.",
      "zh": "两份贷款方案列出的利率相同，但年百分率不同。",
      "references": [
        "https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/what-is-the-difference-between-a-mortgage-interest-rate-and-an-apr-en-135/"
      ],
      "canonicalId": 1839698,
      "canonicalSourceSha256": "20f457a2c25b8e0b80e1f5540c24446d55bd4ba4b640f48b7301c42461451e7d"
    },
    {
