      "zh": "两位评估人员先分别给面试评分，再比较各自的记录。",
      "references": [
        "https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/evaluator"
      ],
      "canonicalId": 2724506,
      "canonicalSourceSha256": "f76769d8621c1038692f00b22ef64d90c8353abfc7fb02a64fc4f191c1cc23e2"
    },
    {
